			"notes": "## Changes\n- Updated to depend on Farmer's Delight 1.3.2. [#135](https://github.com/ChefsDelights/BrewinAndChewin/pull/135) - OskaFlightboom\n- Foods in the mod now use Nourishment in place of Comfort following Comfort's deprecation.\n- The Fabric version now requires loader version 0.19.0 or higher, and must be depended on using Fabric Loom 1.16 or higher.\n- Replaced Fabric ASM as a dependency with a enum extending class tweaker.\n\n## Bugfixes\n- Updated knife tool tag which causes a catastrophic crash when breaking any type of cheese.\n- Updated recipe tags to be compliant with Farmer's Delight 1.3.2, this includes fixes to recipes such as fiery fondue and quiche.\n- Fixed a lack of textures on the coaster tray. [#128](https://github.com/ChrysanthCow/BrewinAndChewin/issues/128)\n- The keg ticking block entity crash has become obsolete with Farmer's Delight 1.3.2 [#120,#121,#124](https://github.com/ChrysanthCow/BrewinAndChewin/issues/120,https://github.com/ChrysanthCow/BrewinAndChewin/issues/121,https://github.com/ChrysanthCow/BrewinAndChewin/issues/124)\n- Fixed rotational block states not rotating when placed inside a structure template that is rotated. [](https://github.com/ChefsDelights/BrewinAndChewin/issues/136) - Rozarke\n- Fixed Coaster blocks missing proper footstep sounds.\n\n## Translation\n- Added Ukranian (uk_ua) translation. [#137](https://github.com/ChefsDelights/BrewinAndChewin/pull/137)\n- Added Bulgarian (bg-bg) translation. [#129](https://github.com/ChefsDelights/BrewinAndChewin/pull/129)"
		},
